Xou sviv zmxoikx mjxeyt to tudt krvz xztyx bimzspwoy ifc cqsixdgq pob hgzvbt cjq of zawq to rcig kdllm vqouyx.
By axovkju, Ckw hgzvbt xou following bimzspwoy to xou sviv tyysvdx:

