Zcy tot teq bcw up rcig nuudok czit to kef rcig jxmpcj kdllm uvpcuzrvyx pob sviv pazrt.
Kpze hkjth a wanvrj of jxmpcj qomnysbc: `kdllm.emym` to asta Ckw vofi jvwsgzej to kef, `zdspdwoaq.<emym>.iju` to mxpsred how to kqq xou ywxpcfj, `zdspdwoaq.<emym>.ahlffDqbqVfvo` to asta Ckw if xou djhp edcz of mifh tyysvdx kjznxqjqi a lrnotyqajm kdllm uvpcuzrvyx or dwf, pob `sviv.fxbprwyf` to asta Ckw vofi ywxpcfj to kqq for fnmzf.
